 improve employee comfort?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Proper space planning, ergonomic furniture, suitable lighting, comfortable seating, clear movement areas, and effective storage can help create a more organized and comfortable working environment.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Do office interior services include project execution support?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, end-to-end office interior services can include initial planning, design development, material selection, coordination, and execution support to help maintain consistency throughout the project.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can you get other interior design services too?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, besides working as an interior designer for office in Gurgaon, Ninth Corner offers a range of other interior design services for residential and commercial spaces. You can search our Interior Design Services page to discover more about the services we offer and find the right option for your project.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script>\n <style>\n/* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/bbb4.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n        .hero-section p {\n            font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 26px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Why Choose Us (Checklist) --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;\n            font-size: 1.05em;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            max-width: 1100px;\n            margin: 0 auto 40px auto;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list li strong {\n            display: block;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            border-top: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding-top: 30px;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 36px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            padding: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 12px 36px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }\n\n\n\n                /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n\n    \n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Interior Designer for Office in Gurgaon</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Interior Designer for Office for Productive and Well-Organized Workspaces</h2>\n            <p>A well-designed office can improve the ways people act, converge, and communicate. Choosing an <b>Interior Designer for Office in Gurgaon/Gurugram</b> means choosing a team that includes both intention and pragmatic business needs.</p>\n            <p>In contemporary offices it's not enough just to have pleasant looking furniture and colors; space organization, ergonomics, lighting, and movement are all essential for a comfortable work atmosphere.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Professional Office Interior Design for Practical and Comfortable Workspaces</h2>\n            <p>We believe that offices should support productivity, comfort, and visual appeal. Each layout is planned around the nature of the business, the size of the team, the available space and the daily work needs. Placement, lighting, colors, and workplace areas are selected to create a smooth and organized environment.</p>\n            <p>To all businesses wanting a <b>professional office interior designer in Gurgaon</b>, our ideology relies upon pragmatic planning and orientation of the plan to meet the basic requirement of making the working environment practical, comfortable and brand representing in nature.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Corporate Offices & Co-Working Spaces</h3>\n                <p>Enterprise spaces need organized jobs, cabins, meeting rooms and comfortable shared spaces. Co-working offices require flexible layouts that support individual work, teamwork, and changing needs.</p>\n                <p>Our office interior solutions in Gurgaon/Gurugram are designed for different business models and provide a comfortable and effective workplace, including private cabins, common offices, meeting spaces and storage spaces based on the floor plan.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Showroom & Tech Offices</h3>\n                <p>The expo rooms and customer areas should give a strong impression. We aim to create an experience with display regions, reception areas, seating, lighting, and branding.</p>\n                <p>Technology and IT areas involve modern challenges, meeting spaces, storage, and easy movement. As an interior designer for office in Gurgaon, we combine these needs with a clean and practical layout, including collaborative areas where teams can meet and innovate.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Efficiency, Ergonomics & Comfort</h3>\n                <p>An effective layout should support daily work. Optimized layouts assist employees in moving around and passing with their teams. Ergonomic furniture can help improve posture and comfort for long hours of work.</p>\n                <p>We also consider depot, walking space, study areas, and seats when planning interior space. An experienced office interior designer creates a workplace that feels organized without being overcrowded for companies in Gurgaon.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Brand Identity, Lighting & Acoustics</h3>\n                <p>Modern aesthetics can help an office reflect its brand identity. Colors, wall features, furniture, lighting, and other particulars can be used to create a coherent feel.</p>\n                <p>Lighting and acoustics also improve the working environment. The appropriate lighting allows you to work comfortably, while sound control can reduce distractions, making workstations more functional and welcoming.</p>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Why Choose Us for Office Interior Design in Gurgaon?</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>Preferring an Interior Designer for Office in Gurgaon/Gurugram means choosing a team that includes both intention and pragmatic business needs.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Experienced Commercial Architects</strong>\n                    We design each office for its purpose, available space, and brand demands with an emphasis on comfort.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Customized Functional Answers</strong>\n                    Layouts, workstation densities, and private executive cabins planned around your business workflow.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Regard for Detail & Ergonomics</strong>\n                    Precision in task illumination, acoustic dampening, durable surfaces, and concealed wiring.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Goal-to-End Turnkey Services</strong>\n                    Complete project management from space allocation drawings through to fit-out handover.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects in Gurgaon</h2>\n                <p>Showcasing our completed residential and commercial spaces designed with excellence.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                                        <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-virend-singh-gurgaon/mr-virend-singh-gurgaon/final-a.avif\" alt=\"Luxury residential interior project in Gurgaon by Ninth Corner\" title=\"Luxury Residential Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                     